{"id":"662828","name":"番茄土豆牛尾骨汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662828/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛尾骨","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛尾骨冷水下锅焯烫后洗净备用。","img":"images/662828/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"生姜切片备用。","img":"images/662828/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片翻炒。","img":"images/662828/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入牛尾骨翻炒均匀。","img":"images/662828/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"炒过的牛尾骨转入高压锅中。","img":"images/662828/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/662828/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大火煮开转中小火压20分钟左右。","img":"images/662828/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"番茄去皮切块。","img":"images/662828/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净切滚刀块。","img":"images/662828/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅中热油放入番茄。","img":"images/662828/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"炒出茄汁。","img":"images/662828/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"炒过的番茄加入压好的牛尾骨汤中。","img":"images/662828/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入土豆。","img":"images/662828/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"煲至土豆粉糯，出锅前少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/662828/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662828/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662828/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}